      "part_type": "Hadith",
      "path": "/books/al-kafi:1:4:75:3",
      "text": [
        " قَالَ أَبُو الْحَسَنِ ( عليه السلام ) صَاحِبُكُمْ بَعْدِيَ الَّذِي يُصَلِّي عَلَيَّ قَالَ وَ لَمْ نَعْرِفْ أَبَا مُحَمَّدٍ قَبْلَ ذَلِكَ قَالَ فَخَرَجَ أَبُو مُحَمَّدٍ فَصَلَّى عَلَيْهِ ."
      ],
      "translations": {
        "en.hubeali": [
          "From him, from Bashhar Bin Ahmad, from Abdullah Bin Muhammad Al Isfahany who said, ",
          "‘Abu Al-Hassan<sup>asws</sup> said: ‘Your Master<sup>asws</sup> after me<sup>asws</sup> is the one who would pray <span class=\"iTxt\">Salat</span> over me<sup>asws</sup>’, and we did not know Abu Muhammad<sup>asws</sup> before that. So Abu Muhammad<sup>asws</sup> came out and prayed <span class=\"iTxt\">Salat</span> over him<sup>asws</sup>’."
        ],
        "en.sarwar": [
          " 3. From him has narrated from Bashshar ibn Ahmad from ‘Abdallah ibn Muhammad al-Isfahani who has said the following. “Abu al-Hassan (a.s.) said, “Your master (Imam) after me will be the one who will perform prayer for me (prayer for burial).” The narrator has said that we did not know abu Muhammad (a.s.) before this. Abu Muhammad came out and prayed (for his burial).”"
        ]
      }
